---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<main id="main" class="home">
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <div class="hero-top"><div class="eyebrow hero-kicker">INDEPENDENT NOTES<br>ON THE DIGITAL WORLD</div><div class="hero-year mono">EST. 2026<br>INDONESIA — ID</div></div>
    <h1>Make room<br><span class="second">for good ideas.</span></h1>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><div class="hero-caption">A PERSONAL JOURNAL<br>ABOUT DESIGN, WEB &<br>THINGS WORTH MAKING.</div><p class="intro">Saya menulis tentang <strong>web, desain, teknologi,</strong> dan proses membangun sesuatu yang sederhana namun bermakna. Ini adalah ruang kerja sekaligus catatan terbuka.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section" id="journal">
    <div class="section-label"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED WRITING</div><h2 class="name">Journal & notes</h2></div><div class="desc">Pemikiran, proses, dan catatan yang ingin saya simpan — bukan sekadar mengikuti tren.</div><div class="count mono">SHOWING 04 / {{ collections.posts.length }} POSTS</div></div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts.slice(0, 4) %}
      <article class="work"><div class="num index">{{ loop.index | pad2 }}</div><div><h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p><div class="work-foot"><div class="tags">{% for tag in post.data.tags %}{% if tag != "post" %}<span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div><time class="date" datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | shortDate }}</time></div></div></article>
      {% else %}<p class="empty-note">Tulisan pertama sedang disiapkan.</p>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="archive-link"><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/journal/' | url }}">VIEW ALL JOURNAL ENTRIES {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section objects-home" id="objects">
    <div class="section-label"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / SMALL DIGITAL GOODS</div><h2 class="name">Objects & experiments</h2></div><div class="desc">Template, tools, dan digital objects yang dibuat dari kebutuhan nyata — dirancang agar selaras dengan cara kerja yang sederhana.</div><div class="count mono">SHOWING 02 / {{ collections.objects.length }} OBJECTS</div></div>
    <div class="object-list">
      {% for object in collections.objects.slice(0, 2) %}
      <article class="object-row">
        <a class="object-art" href="{{ object.url | url }}" aria-label="View {{ object.data.title }}"><span class="art-index">OBJECT / {{ loop.index | pad2 }}</span><strong>{{ object.data.coverText or object.data.shortName or "FORM / FUNCTION" }}</strong><span class="art-foot">SEKELEBAT® — DIGITAL OBJECT</span></a>
        <div class="object-info"><div class="object-kind">{{ object.data.category }} <span> / {{ object.data.status }}</span></div><h2><a href="{{ object.url | url }}">{{ object.data.title }}</a></h2><p>{{ object.data.description }}</p><div class="object-bottom"><span class="meta">{{ object.data.format }}</span><a class="text-link" href="{{ object.url | url }}">EXPLORE OBJECT {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></div></div>
      </article>
      {% else %}<p class="empty-note">Digital objects sedang disiapkan.</p>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="archive-link"><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/objects/' | url }}">VIEW ALL OBJECTS {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section after-work" id="about">
    <div class="about-layout"><div class="about-title"><div class="eyebrow">03 / A LITTLE ABOUT ME</div><div class="about-subtitle">The person behind it.</div></div><p class="about-copy">Saya suka membuat website yang terasa <em>quietly confident</em> — jelas, cepat, dan punya alasan untuk setiap detailnya.</p><div class="about-aside">DESIGN-LED<br>PERFORMANCE-MINDED<br>ALWAYS LEARNING.</div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap closing"><div class="eyebrow">A NOTE BEFORE YOU LEAVE</div><h2>Good things take<br>thought, not noise.</h2><div class="closing-row"><p>Terima kasih sudah mampir. Semoga ada satu ide kecil di sini yang bisa kamu bawa.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/journal/' | url }}">Explore the journal {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></div></section>
</main>